            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Evolving financial and medical constraints fueled by the increasing repertoire of nonoperating room cases and widening scope of patient comorbidities are discussed. The need to integrate finances and care approaches is detailed, and strategic suggestions for broader collaborative practice are suggested.</AbstractText>
                <CopyrightInformation>Published by Elsevier Inc.</CopyrightInformation>
            </Abstract>
